{"v":1,"tab":"series","at":1795461011421,"rows":[{"id":"pg-trending-series","title":"Tendencias en series","titleEn":"Trending series","items":[{"id":"pg-t-303552","ref":"pg:t:s:303552:2026:","title":"대리수능","kind":"series","year":"2026","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oz3eIoEpmPqeu0qvaylynGbxCL5.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/31kyh4GXFgv0T7I2y9pwT5LFbUC.jpg","ids":{"tmdb":303552}},{"id":"pg-t-247718","ref":"pg:t:s:247718:2025:tierra-de-mafia","title":"Tierra de Mafia","kind":"series","year":"2025","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7ye2BFq4HjGMi0dGkzGu5c2fyz.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h0OC7ouop8YLwbAVfS3UUE2Lw4T.jpg","overview":"El poder está en juego cuando dos familias criminales rivales se enfrentan y arriesgan sus imperios y sus vidas. En el fuego cruzado está Harry Da Souza, un astuto \"solucionador\" que sabe dónde están las lealtades cuando las fuerzas opuestas chocan.","rating":8.7,"ids":{"tmdb":247718},"originalTitle":"MobLand"},{"id":"pg-t-290826","ref":"pg:t:s:290826:2026:dig","title":"Dig","kind":"series","year":"2026","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5zO3rEJVkxDTPudMMZNh1tief3.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8onvZbxTmP3XpuzKfLsBSm3WXMg.jpg","rating":5.3,"ids":{"tmdb":290826}},{"id":"pg-t-300523","ref":"pg:t:s:300523:2026:el-camino-azul","title":"El camino azul","kind":"series","year":"2026","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knb9JmYjCpBfMxFRfGhslV8fzxV.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7ojpD6ARKYhRxnsjzMIrorOfj4T.jpg","overview":"Dos inspectores colaboran tras una oleada de asesinatos brutales y mensajes en clave que trascienden fronteras. La verdad, sin embargo, acecha peligrosamente cerca.","rating":7.6,"ids":{"tmdb":300523},"originalTitle":"푸른길"},{"id":"pg-t-291507","ref":"pg:t:s:291507:2026:el-cuerpo","title":"El cuerpo","kind":"series","year":"2026","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmuXlkAxFTgy3TpWFf5cJ7Xw05c.jpg","bac